{"repositoryId":418171349,"availability":"available","full":"Hostlife22/stillroom","name":"stillroom","description":"Interactive 3D cloth simulation built with React and Three.js. Drag a linen curtain, add wind, and cut fabric in a cozy room with real-time physics","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2021-10-17T15:19:12Z","updated":"2026-10-02T09:07:47Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hostlife22.github.io/stillroom/","topics":["cloth-simulation","creative-coding","github-pages","interactive-demo","javascript","particle-system","physics-simulation","react","threejs","verlet-integration","vite","webgl"],"demo":"https://hostlife22.github.io/stillroom/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:13:31.524Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:13:31.524Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:13:31.524Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T07:13:31.524Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An interactive cloth playground in a cozy, sunlit room. Pull the linen curtain, let a breeze in, or cut the fabric and watch it fall. Stillroom combines a calm interface with a real particle simulation written in TypeScript and rendered in Three.js."],"features":["Grab the curtain. Pick a point on the fabric and drag it. Connected particles pull their neighbors along, then settle when released.","Add wind. Adjust the continuous breeze, hold the Wind tool to apply a gust, or press A little gust.","Cut the fabric. Draw across the curtain to break connections. Detached sections fall under gravity; reset restores the whole curtain.","Change the feel. Tune stiffness and damping for a more fluid or structured fabric.","Set the mood. Choose Sage, Oat, Clay, Mist, or Charcoal linen; switch lighting; or start with a Gentle morning, Open windows, or Quiet evening preset."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hostlife22/stillroom/blob/main/README.md","